WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:01.835
Every journey...

00:00:02.377 --> 00:00:03.586
has to begin somewhere.

00:00:05.005 --> 00:00:06.172
I came up with that.

00:00:07.173 --> 00:00:08.258
Last season,

00:00:08.383 --> 00:00:09.759
I saw the world 

00:00:09.759 --> 00:00:10.552
in a new light.

00:00:11.344 --> 00:00:11.970
Now,

00:00:11.970 --> 00:00:13.471
I’m back on the road

00:00:13.471 --> 00:00:15.265
and taking on Europe.

00:00:19.144 --> 00:00:22.480
Forty-seven different
kinds of mosquitoes? 

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:24.774
Now I’m really excited
about this trip.

00:00:24.774 --> 00:00:25.525
[Laughs]

00:00:27.110 --> 00:00:29.279
I’ll educate my taste buds…

00:00:29.279 --> 00:00:30.864
Wow, that was so good!

00:00:30.864 --> 00:00:33.658
experience some beautiful hotels…

00:00:35.326 --> 00:00:37.328
continue to test my limits…

00:00:37.328 --> 00:00:38.747
Look at me, no hands.

00:00:39.914 --> 00:00:42.333
and give my family tree a shake.

00:00:43.084 --> 00:00:44.461
That’s a workout.

00:00:44.461 --> 00:00:46.212
Luckily, I’ve got air conditioning.

00:00:46.212 --> 00:00:46.588
[Laughing]

00:00:46.588 --> 00:00:47.964
Way out of my element here.

00:00:49.340 --> 00:00:50.133
Way out.

00:00:51.051 --> 00:00:52.510
These are the moments

00:00:53.053 --> 00:00:53.595
 you remember.

00:00:54.804 --> 00:00:56.639
Here is a panic button.

00:00:56.639 --> 00:00:58.433
Why would somebody
need a panic button?

00:01:00.435 --> 00:01:01.603
Oh my God.

